WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.113
[Low strings as the order is given]

00:01.133 --> 00:02.380
[Rotor blades turn as the squad moves]

00:02.400 --> 00:05.113
[Helicopter rotors over the suspended vehicle]

00:05.133 --> 00:07.513
[Tank tracks approach along the village road]

00:07.533 --> 00:08.213
[Tank tracks rumble]

00:08.233 --> 00:09.913
[Fire cracks beside the trench]

00:09.933 --> 00:11.013
[Mortar fires from the sandbag pit]

00:11.033 --> 00:12.680
[The round strikes the field]

00:12.700 --> 00:15.080
[Boats approach the shore]

00:15.100 --> 00:16.480
[Surf as the squad runs ashore]

00:16.500 --> 00:18.413
[Patrol ship fires as a boat passes]

00:18.433 --> 00:20.713
[Jet engines climb over the harbour]

00:20.733 --> 00:23.980
[Bombs strike the quay. The truck erupts.]
